2. modifying some legacy functions that are called in openopt/funcdesigner/etc
a) add 
def asscalar(x):
    return x.item()
at the top of the numpy init.py file (located in the sitepackage of your venv)

b) in  openopt/kernel/ooIter.py  (inthe site-packages of your venv) replace, 
from time import time,  clock 
with 
from time import time, perf_counter as clock 
; same, in openopt/kernel/runProbSolver.py ; and in result.py
replace the time code line with
from time import time, localtime,perf_counter as clock   

c) in lib/python3.11/site-packages/openopt/kernel/ooMisc.py , replace the occurence of .A.A by .A.toarray()
   p.A = p.A.A   ->   p.A = p.A.toarray()
    


